2026-10-16T14:42:00.3393550Z     "The repair correctly identifies that arbitrary symmetry reduction is not sufficient for center growth, and that an invariant abelian extension is the exact criterion.",
2026-10-16T14:42:00.3394397Z     "The repair correctly optimizes the factor seed to rank-one seeds by convexity and unitary invariance, and establishes the D/2 bound for fully unitary-covariant registers.",
2026-10-16T14:42:00.3395083Z     "The repair correctly handles zero/degenerate cases and restricts divisions to nonzero contrast.",
2026-10-16T14:42:00.3395729Z     "The repair correctly clarifies that a diffuse orientation-bearing component is required, not necessarily a full frame or a wholly diffuse record.",
2026-10-16T14:42:00.3396554Z     "The repair correctly notes that distinguishing events need not attain optimal TV and that finite noncovariant decisions do not contradict the finite covariant-register theorem.",
2026-10-16T14:42:00.3397227Z     "The repair correctly states that old original reviews do not certify the new bytes."
2026-10-16T14:42:00.3397561Z   ]
